# Bilibili negative-path: empty body. Pinned to PR-1.6's indexOf -1
# guards in update_fans_num: a missing follower / following marker
# must not feed a negative index into substring().
#
# Uses the http_fixture directive (added in the same backlog as this
# scenario) to route the bilibili relation/stat URL — which has uid in
# the query string and therefore can't be swapped via flash_seed — to
# an empty fixture file. With the guard in place, update_fans_num
# logs "follower/following marker missing — skipping refresh" and
# leaves run_data->fans_num / follow_num at their zero defaults.

app bilibili
http_fixture relation/stat bilibili_negative/empty.json

wait_ms 400
assert_no_crash

action UP
wait_ms 400
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
